          "guid": "mt4bc7saf2sdue77",
          "message": {
            "text": "The gate separates three coordinate contracts so a CSS-pixel screenshot envelope cannot weaken the ticket's one-device-pixel icon-content bound. Live CDP geometry stays at 1/64 CSS px; only CopyFromSurface's outward crop envelope gets one CSS px; decoded source-versus-emitted alpha bounds and RGBA evidence remain device-pixel based.",
            "markdown": "The gate separates three coordinate contracts so a CSS-pixel screenshot envelope cannot weaken the ticket's one-device-pixel icon-content bound. Live CDP geometry stays at 1/64 CSS px; only CopyFromSurface's outward crop envelope gets one CSS px; decoded source-versus-emitted alpha bounds and RGBA evidence remain device-pixel based."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/broken-image-fallback-oracle.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 38,
                  "endLine": 45,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "export const BROKEN_IMAGE_GATE_THRESHOLDS = {\n  geometryCssPx: 1 / 64,\n  // CopyFromSurface clips are conservatively snapped to whole CSS pixels;\n  // content alpha is checked separately below in device pixels.\n  cropEnvelopeCssPx: 1,\n  iconBoundDevicePx: 1,\n  iconRgbaMeanError: 0.01,\n  iconPixelMismatchFraction: 0.04,"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
